  "description": "SM01 META Electric Off-Road Bike | 13.5kW High-Performance Moto\n\nThe ultimate adventure companion has arrived. The SM01 6000 WATTS META is engineered for thrill-seekers who refuse to compromise. Built to bridge the gap between mountain bikes and motocross, this electric powerhouse delivers the raw torque needed to conquer vertical climbs while maintaining the stealthy, eco-friendly footprint of an electric vehicle.\n\nWhether you’re shredding technical single-track or navigating open desert, the SM01 META combines rugged durability with a sleek, modern aesthetic that turns heads in every environment.\n\nWhy the SM01 META Rules the Trail\n\nUnmatched Power-to-Weight: Experience a peak output of 13.5kW, allowing for blistering acceleration and a top speed of over 60 MPH.\n\nNext-Gen Energy: Powered by a 74V 50Ah Semi-Solid State NCM battery. This isn’t your standard lithium pack—it’s safer, more stable under heat, and offers a longer cycle life.\n\nSilent Performance: Tackle the toughest trails without the noise complaints. The Permanent Magnet Synchronous Motor (PMSM) provides instant, quiet torque.\n\nPrecision Handling: Featuring FAST adjustable suspension with 240mm of travel, the META soaks up heavy landings and rocky terrain with ease.\n\nAll-Weather Ready: With an IP67 waterproof rating on the motor, battery, and controller, you can ride through mud, rain, and creek crossings with total confidence.",
